{"strongs": "H2066", "word": "זָבָד", "translit": "za.vad", "root": "זבב", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "he hath given", "definition": "זָבָד proper name, masculine ( he hath given , or, a gift ; compare Sabean proper name זבדם Hal 168 DHM ZMG 1883, 15 , זביד DHM Epigr. Denkm. 50 = ; also Late Hebrew proper name זביד ) — 1. a descendant of Judah 1Chr 2:36 ; 1Chr 2:37 . 2. an Ephraimite 1Chr 7:21 . 3. one of David's valiant men 1Chr 11:41 . 4. one of the murderers of Joash of Judah 2Chr 24:26 ( ᵐ5 Ζαβελ , Ζαβεθ , Ζαβαθ ), called יוֺזָכָר (q. v. below הוה , יהוה ) 2Kgs 12:22 . 5. name of three returned exiles who had taken strange wives: \\ \\ a. Ezra 10:27 \\ \\ b. v Ezra 10:33 \\ \\ c. v Ezra 10:43 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2270')\">BDB2270</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2066')\">H2066</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2269')\">BDB2269</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2271')\">BDB2271</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>זָבָד</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>he hath given</highlight>, or, <highlight>a gift</highlight>; compare Sabean proper name <bdbheb>זבדם</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hal')\">Hal<sup>168</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>ZMG 1883, 15</sup></lookup>, <bdbheb>זביד</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>Epigr. Denkm. 50</sup></lookup> = <placeholder1367/>; also Late Hebrew proper name <bdbheb>זביד</bdbheb>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> a descendant of Judah <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:36\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,36)\">1Chr 2:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:37\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,37)\">1Chr 2:37</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> an Ephraimite <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,21)\">1Chr 7:21</ref>. </div><div cl